--------------------
// @@@ If the index is valid (greater than or equal to 0 and less than the size of the list), then for every index from 0 up to, but not including, the specified index, the element at each position either remains null if it was originally null, or remains unchanged if it was not null.
--------------------
// @@@ If the index is valid (non-negative and less than the size of the list), then for every index from 0 up to, but not including, the specified index, either both the current and previous values at that position are null, or the current value at that position remains unchanged from its previous value.
